{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1160713-hunter-the-reckoning-20th-anniversary-edition","id":1160713,"title":"Hunter: the Reckoning 20th Anniversary Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-19T18:07:08-08:00","id":1160713,"title":"Hunter: the Reckoning 20th Anniversary Edition","content":"Is OPP going to make a 20th Anniversary edition for H:tR? If not, why? And how do we get them to change their minds? I would contribute to a Kickstarter, if that's what it took. And I know a lot of other people who would, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13102-driver_85","name":"driver_85","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T18:20:49-08:00","id":1160717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>driver_85</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1160713-hunter-the-reckoning-20th-anniversary-edition#post1160713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is OPP going to make a 20th Anniversary edition for H:tR? If not, why? And how do we get them to change their minds? I would contribute to a Kickstarter, if that's what it took. And I know a lot of other people who would, too.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's still 2 years away from it being the actual 20th Anniversary. The WoD20 KSes only go up during the actual year of the anniversary. They don't get completed and released on the year of the anniversary.<br /> <br /> We still got a bit of waiting to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T19:04:12-08:00","id":1160730,"title":"","content":"Also, keep in mind that Onyx Path doesn't have 100% control over the future of the 20th books.<br /> <br /> Since Paradox bought the properties, and started the new White Wolf, they have final say over this. They've said that all announced 20th books will be produced, but we have had zero word on other books; and White Wolf is working on a brand new edition and there seems to be the intention to start to phase out the 20th books to avoid competition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T19:13:46-08:00","id":1160735,"title":"","content":"Is it already time for another of these threads? The last one may have been months ago, but it feels like yesterday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath